   - Replaced duplicate hand-rolled batch row validator in [`inventory.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/inventory.py#L320-L335) with `row_object_fault(..., skip_fields=frozenset({"observer"}))`.
   - Committed as `536f737f`: `refactor(migrate): parameterise row_object_fault to deduplicate batch validation (P3)`.
3. **WP2 Deliverables**:
   - Implemented [`migrate.transform`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/transform.py) with [`transform()`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/transform.py#L115), [`GenesisRequirements`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/transform.py#L86-L90), [`TransformExceptions`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/transform.py#L93-L104), and [`TransformResult`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/libs/migrate/src/migrate/transform.py#L107-L112).
   - Implemented group grammar (single-observer batch line → 1 batch record; flat rows → fact records; never regroup).
   - Implemented M-4 native-tick conversion with verbatim signed envelope byte preservation.
   - Implemented key introduction construction signed by custodian per Arrival engine authority grammar (`arrival.py:1962-1970`).
   - Implemented §G.3 exception edges (`keyless_declared_observers`, `undeclared_row_observers`).
   - Updated Rule 4 dependency DAG in [`tests/architecture/test_rule_04_lib_dependency_dag.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp2/tests/architecture/test_rule_04_lib_dependency_dag.py#L32-L35) for `"migrate": {"engine", "lang"}`.
